gt;CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB 데이터는 eCRF의 Data Tool 파일에 존재하는데, sheet 0에 MSI와 TMB, sheet 1에 CNV 정보, sheet 2에 Fusion 정보가 있다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FMI 데이터 정제</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/research/ncc-works/nw12/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/research/ncc-works/nw12/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="fmi-데이터-정제"&gt;&#10; FMI 데이터 정제&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#fmi-%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0-%ec%a0%95%ec%a0%9c"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-07-03&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-작업-개요"&gt;&#10; 1. 작업 개요&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%ea%b0%9c%ec%9a%94"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="668" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2301c3c-63d0-49fc-9010-010bd2debbae" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="670" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64212420-8218-484c-97c5-34da84c62442" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;FMI 데이터를 위와 같은 형식으로 정제하는 작업 요청을 받았다. BIO 시트와 VAF 시트를 갖고 있는 엑셀 파일이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="768" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47286dd7-0964-44da-a345-466a8eab9675" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;샘플별 FMI 데이터는 pdf 형식도 있고 xml 형식도 있는데 엑셀 파일로 만들어달라는걸 보면 xml 파일을 사용해야할것으로 생각되어서 xml을 쓰기로 했다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="2-작업-내용"&gt;&#10; 2. 작업 내용&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#2-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%eb%82%b4%ec%9a%a9"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; os&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pandas &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; pd&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;os&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;getcwd() &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# &amp;#39;C:\\Users\\User\\Documents\\yshid\\2607\\bin&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;all_files &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; os&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;listdir(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\\&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;10.32.91.11\core\03. [로슈]정밀 의료 생태계 구축 사업\04. FMI&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;xml_files &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [f &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; f &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; all_files &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; f&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;lower()&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;endswith(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.xml&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;len(xml_files) &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 96&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;우선 전체 FMI 파일 수는 96개이다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>